      "statement": "Per-paper annotation files under annotations/ are created lazily (only once a reviewer writes something for that paper) and deleted again if the tree becomes empty; a project saved in the old single-file shape still opens and is migrated to the split layout automatically on the next save, with no explicit migrate step.",
